    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h1>BUZZ</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u201cCobysoft Co.\u2019s monster-collecting visual novel is a glimpse into a gorgeous, chimerical 3D world inspired by \u201890s game box clay dioramas \u2013 but made purely with software.\u201d - <i>Edge</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u201c..I\u2019m still not fully sure what this game is, but I know that I\u2019m really, really into it.\u201d \u2013 <i>IGN</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u201cThere\u2019s nothing else out there that looks like Dome-King Cabbage, and it\u2019s everything I want.\u201d - <i>Kotaku</i></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2092510/extras/d8b79c121f76b351af59ddf49fa1f136.poster.avif?t=1737476883\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2092510/extras/d8b79c121f76b351af59ddf49fa1f136.webm?t=1737476883\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2092510/extras/d8b79c121f76b351af59ddf49fa1f136.mp4?t=1737476883\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dome-King Cabbage is an award-winning visual novel about a cloud-person named Mush nervously making their way to a job interview. Mush has to grapple with their ability to perceive the world through the lens of a monster-collecting RPG.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">What Kind of Game Is It, Exactly?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dome-King Cabbage is a visual novel first and foremost. It deftly weaves between evocative prose, psychedelic animated shorts, dynamic manga pages, and even has a brief RPG section. It\u2019s something that truly needs to be experienced to be understood.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2092510/extras/81d52e73ae127c3fb0a80c4318e4026c.poster.avif?t=1737476883\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2092510/extras/81d52e73ae127c3fb0a80c4318e4026c.webm?t=1737476883\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2092510/extras/81d52e73ae127c3fb0a80c4318e4026c.mp4?t=1737476883\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">An Adventure Awaits</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Journey to the enigmatic Crumb Island with Mush and speak to various monsters, uncovering the obscured mysteries of the world and what it means to be a Dome-King.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2092510/extras/1c65aaa1811e3f2a91831c92215b3142.poster.avif?t=1737476883\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2092510/extras/1c65aaa1811e3f2a91831c92215b3142.webm?t=1737476883\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2092510/extras/1c65aaa1811e3f2a91831c92215b3142.mp4?t=1737476883\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Welcome to Crumb Island</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Navigate your way through the island in search of The Interviewer, and experience the splintered memories of Mush and the creatures they meet along the way. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2092510/extras/044b25e0edeba41eff18759b722817a3.poster.avif?t=1737476883\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2092510/extras/044b25e0edeba41eff18759b722817a3.webm?t=1737476883\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2092510/extras/044b25e0edeba41eff18759b722817a3.mp4?t=1737476883\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">A Visual Novel With a Twist</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience a visual novel with a unique dynamism that hasn\u2019t been seen before. It\u2019s a densely animated collage of eye-watering visuals set to skittering, genre-defying beats. Playing Dome-King Cabbage is like looking into a distorted memory of a lost monster-collecting RPG. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2092510/extras/b707341a33d1f3168f9cd2f4849b8795.poster.avif?t=1737476883\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2092510/extras/b707341a33d1f3168f9cd2f4849b8795.webm?t=1737476883\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2092510/extras/b707341a33d1f3168f9cd2f4849b8795.mp4?t=1737476883\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p>",
