\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2092510/extras/b707341a33d1f3168f9cd2f4849b8795.poster.avif?t=1737476883\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2092510/extras/b707341a33d1f3168f9cd2f4849b8795.webm?t=1737476883\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2092510/extras/b707341a33d1f3168f9cd2f4849b8795.mp4?t=1737476883\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p>",
